#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/Config.md:1
msgid "triton.Config"
msgstr ""

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/Config.md:7
msgid "表示自动调优可能尝试的内核配置的对象"
msgstr "Represents a kernel configuration object that autotuning may attempt"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/Config.md:9
msgid "**变量：**"
msgstr "**Variables:**"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/Config.md:11
msgid "kwargs – 1 个元参数字典，用于作为关键字参数传递给内核。"
msgstr ""
"kwargs – A dictionary of meta-parameters to be passed as keyword arguments "
"to the kernel."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/Config.md:13
msgid ""
"num_warps – 在为 GPU 编译时内核使用的线程数。例如，如果 num_warps=8，则每个内核实例将自动并行化，使用 8 * 32 = "
"256 个线程协作执行。"
msgstr ""
"num_warps – The number of warps used by the kernel when compiling for GPU. "
"For example, if num_warps=8, each kernel instance will be automatically "
"parallelized using 8 * 32 = 256 threads working together."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/Config.md:15
msgid "num_stages – 编译器在软件流水线循环时应使用的阶段数。对于 SM80+ GPU 上的矩阵乘法工作负载非常有用。"
msgstr ""
"num_stages – The number of stages the compiler should use when software-"
"pipelining a loop. Useful for matrix multiplication workloads on SM80+ GPUs."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/Config.md:17
msgid "num_ctas - 块集群中的块数。仅适用于 SM90+。"
msgstr "num_ctas - Number of CTAs in a CTA cluster. Only applies to SM90+."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/Config.md:19
msgid "maxnreg - 单个线程可以使用的最大寄存器数。对应于 ptx 的 .maxnreg 指令。并非所有平台都支持。"
msgstr ""
"maxnreg - Maximum number of registers a single thread can use. Corresponds "
"to the ptx .maxnreg directive. Not supported on all platforms."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/Config.md:21
msgid "pre_hook – 在调用内核之前将被调用的函数。该函数的参数是 args。"
msgstr ""
"pre_hook – A function to be called before invoking the kernel. The "
"function's argument is args."

#: ../../zh/triton_api/triton/Config.md:27
msgid "**方法：**"
msgstr "**Methods:**"

